WEBVTT

00:11:57.904 --> 00:12:01.376
It's not the same thing as good, better and best.

00:12:01.376 --> 00:12:03.877
This is a country which simply gives more

00:12:03.877 --> 00:12:06.203
to humanity than any other country.

00:12:06.203 --> 00:12:07.945
I don't talk about how they behave at home

00:12:07.945 --> 00:12:10.345
because that's measured elsewhere.

00:12:10.345 --> 00:12:12.405
And the winner is

00:12:12.405 --> 00:12:14.216
Ireland.

00:12:14.216 --> 00:12:19.890
(Applause)

00:12:19.890 --> 00:12:21.795
According to the data here,

00:12:21.795 --> 00:12:24.685
no country on Earth, per head of population,

00:12:24.685 --> 00:12:27.610
per dollar of GDP, contributes more

00:12:27.610 --> 00:12:29.246
to the world that we live in than Ireland.

00:12:29.246 --> 00:12:30.341
What does this mean?